  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of the project is to alleviate the anxiety and enhance the self-esteem of LGBTQ participants in this programme through artistic healing forms such as music meditation, dance groups and theatrical performances. Through dialogue and story sharing, in-depth understanding, the goal is to improve the participants&apos; self-esteem and self-identity, equipping them to better face the challenges of the Chinese social environment for LGBTQ people.</narrative>
